planation":"\\(5-(2x-3)=5-2x+3=8-2x\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_025","question":"Cho \\(A=2x+3\\), \\(B=x-5\\). Rút gọn \\(A-2B\\).","options":["\\(13\\)","\\(4x-7\\)","\\(x+8\\)","\\(3x-2\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["cong-tru-da-thuc","bo-ngoac-dau"],"type":"cong-tru"},"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"\\(A-2B=2x+3-2(x-5)=2x+3-2x+10=13\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_026","question":"Rút gọn \\((2a-b)+(3a+4b)\\).","options":["\\(5a+3b\\)","\\(5a+5b\\)","\\(a+3b\\)","\\(6a+3b\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["cong-tru-da-thuc","bo-ngoac-dau"],"type":"cong-tru"},"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"Gộp các hạng tử đồng dạng: \\(2a+3a=5a\\), \\(-b+4b=3b\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_027","question":"Rút gọn \\((6m+2)-(4m-7)\\).","options":["\\(2m+9\\)","\\(2m-5\\)","\\(10m+9\\)","\\(2m-9\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["cong-tru-da-thuc","bo-ngoac-dau"],"type":"cong-tru"},"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"\\(6m+2-4m+7=2m+9\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_028","question":"Rút gọn \\(3x-(2x-(x-1))\\).","options":["\\(2x-1\\)","\\(4x-1\\)","\\(2x+1\\)","\\(x-1\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["cong-tru-da-thuc","bo-ngoac-dau"],"type":"cong-tru"},"difficulty":"intermediate","explanation":"Trong ngoặc: \\(2x-(x-1)=x+1\\). Do đó \\(3x-(x+1)=2x-1\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_029","question":"Rút gọn \\((x^2+x)+(2x^2-3x)-(x^2-2x)\\).","options":["\\(2x^2\\)","\\(2x^2-4x\\)","\\(4x^2\\)","\\(2x\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["cong-tru-da-thuc","bo-ngoac-dau"],"type":"cong-tru"},"difficulty":"intermediate","explanation":"Đổi dấu ngoặc cuối: \\(x^2+x+2x^2-3x-x^2+2x=2x^2\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_030","question":"Rút gọn \\(7a-[2a-(3a-1)]\\).","options":["\\(8a-1\\)","\\(2a+1\\)","\\(6a+1\\)","\\(12a-1\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["cong-tru-da-thuc","bo-ngoac-dau"],"type":"cong-tru"},"difficulty":"intermediate","explanation":"Trước hết \\(2a-(3a-1)=-a+1\\). Sau đó \\(