út gọn \\(x(x+5)-2x\\).","options":["\\(x^2+3x\\)","\\(x^2+7x\\)","\\(x^2+5\\)","\\(3x^2\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["nhan-bieu-thuc","tinh-phan-phoi"],"type":"nhan"},"difficulty":"intermediate","explanation":"\\(x(x+5)=x^2+5x\\). Trừ \\(2x\\) còn \\(x^2+3x\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_038","question":"Rút gọn \\(2(x+1)(x-1)\\) bằng cách nhân trực tiếp.","options":["\\(2x^2-2\\)","\\(2x^2+2\\)","\\(2x^2-4x-2\\)","\\(x^2-1\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["nhan-bieu-thuc","tinh-phan-phoi"],"type":"nhan"},"difficulty":"intermediate","explanation":"\\((x+1)(x-1)=x^2-1\\), nhân \\(2\\) được \\(2x^2-2\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_039","question":"Rút gọn \\(3x(2x-1)-x(x+4)\\).","options":["\\(5x^2-7x\\)","\\(7x^2-5x\\)","\\(5x^2+x\\)","\\(6x^2-7x\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["nhan-bieu-thuc","tinh-phan-phoi"],"type":"nhan"},"difficulty":"intermediate","explanation":"\\(6x^2-3x-(x^2+4x)=5x^2-7x\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_040","question":"Rút gọn \\((x+1)(x+2)-x(x+3)\\).","options":["2","\\(2x\\)","\\(x+2\\)","\\(x^2+2\\)"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["nhan-bieu-thuc","tinh-phan-phoi"],"type":"nhan"},"difficulty":"intermediate","explanation":"Vế đầu là \\(x^2+3x+2\\), vế sau là \\(x^2+3x\\). Hiệu bằng \\(2\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_041","question":"Tính \\(P=x^2-3x+2\\) tại \\(x=2\\).","options":["0","2","4","-2"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["tinh-gia-tri-bieu-thuc"],"type":"thay-so"},"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"Thay \\(x=2\\): \\(2^2-3\\cdot2+2=4-6+2=0\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_042","question":"Tính \\(A=2x+5\\) tại \\(x=-3\\).","options":["-1","1","11","-11"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-thuc-dai-so","skill":["tinh-gia-tri-bieu-thuc"],"type":"thay-so"},"difficulty":"basic","explanation":"Thay \\(x=-3\\): \\(2(-3)+5=-6+5=-1\\)."},{"id":"ALG04_043","question":"Tính \\(B=3a^2-2a\\) tại \\(a=-1\\).","options":["5","1","-5","-1"],"answer":0,"tags":{"topic":"bieu-t